B.aH1=s(["track my childs progress","track my child's progress","child progress","see my childs progress","how is my child doing","my childs progress"],t.s)
B.bzG=new A.O(B.aH1,"In the family area of the Wasia Academy, once a child is added their lessons, quiz answers and exam scores appear there.\n[GO:/academy/family]")
